          <div class="pitfall-item">
            <h4>Over-Compacting Rounded Aggregates</h4>
            <p>
              Never attempt to mechanically compact clean pea gravel or smooth river stone with a plate tamper.
              Rounded stones do not interlock and will displace sideways, potentially damaging the compactor shoe and puncturing subgrade fabric.
